// Crafting stage 2 (doc 93 §4): the sources of knowledge through the real host. A carrier is studied by hand anywhere
// (a job in world time; a copy may carry an error decided by the seed and the sheet), a master teaches at the open stall
// while the hero sits at the bench (relation and fee), a person near tells a schematic by relation, a carrier that is not
// the hero's is stolen (a case of the justice ladder), a thing is inspected for a master's swap, an order is cancelled
// by the refund rules. All of it is the same engine for the hero and the NPCs; nothing here is a rule of its own.
